Di Sakina Ne Sada Aaye Mere Bhaiya Asghar<br>
Asghar Mere Asghar - Asghar Mere Asghar<br>
Aa Bhija Tujh Ku Bulati Hai Yeh Behna Asghar<br>
<br>
1.Hum Pe Pardes Me Kaisi Yeh Qayamath Aayi<br>
Saara Ghar Luth Gaya Bus Ek hi Din Me Bhai<br>
Kaisi Jeepayengi Ab Teri Yeh Bhena Asghar<br>
<br>
2.Laaye They Jab Tujhe Seene Se Laga Kar Baba<br>
Meri Aankhoun Ne Qayamath Ka Wo Manzar dekha<br>
Tha Tere Khoon Se Tar Baba Ka Chehra Asghar<br>
<br>
3.Gham Yeh Aisa Hai Behan Sughra Na Seh Payengi<br>
Tere Marne Ki Khabar Sunke Wo Mar Jayengi<br>
Takhti Hungi Wo Fakath Apna Hi Rasta Asghar<br>
<br>
4.Jab Mila Paani Sar-e-Sham-e-Ghareeba Mujhku<br>
Pyaas Me Rote Howe Yaad Kiya Bus Tujhku<br>
Maine Hargis Na Piya Ek Bhi Khatra Asghar<br>
<br>
5.Bhaiya Abid Ke Siwa Ab Koi Baakhi Na Raha<br>
Haste Jaate Hai Hume Qaidi Banakar Aada<br>
Har Khadam Shimr Lagata Tamacha Asghar<br>
<br>
6.Mujhku Tadhpaya Hai Iss Tarah Jafakarou Ne<br>
Dil Ku Yun Aag Lagayi Hai Sitamgarou Ne<br>
Samne Mere Jalaya Tera Jhoola Asghar<br>
<br>
7.Nouha Padhti Hai Fizayain Bhi Teri Ghurbat Pe<br>
Yeh Sitam Dhayan Hai Aada Ne Teri Turbath Pe<br>
Mar Kar Naiza Nikala Tera Laasha Asghar<br>
<br>
8.Zulm Yeh Baad-e-Shahdath Bhi Howa Hai Tujh par<br>
Pheera zalim Ne Tere Zakhmi Gaale Par Khanjar<br>
Sar Chadhaya Hai Tera Bar Sar-e-Naiza Asghar<br>
<br>
9.Aaye Kamal Aati Hai Yeh Khabre Sakina Se Sada<br>
Khakh Pe Sar Hai Mera Aur Main Hu Sabse Juda<br>
Tujh Ku Turbath Me Mila Baba Ka Seena Asghar
